# 🎧 Earpods Lost and Found Tracker

A Java-based application designed to report, track, search, and manage lost and found Earpods efficiently.

## 📌 Description

The Earpods Lost and Found Tracker helps users maintain records of lost and found Earpods using unique IDs, brand, color, timestamps, and report status. The system allows users to create reports, search for Earpods, view recent unresolved cases, and update the status of resolved reports.

## ✨ Features

* Report lost Earpods
* Report found Earpods
* Generate unique report IDs
* Search Earpods by brand
* Search Earpods by color
* View latest unresolved reports
* Resolve existing reports
* View all reports
* Automatic timestamp generation
* Input validation and error handling

