## ⚡ Data Structures

### HashMap

A `HashMap` is used to store reports using unique report IDs. It provides efficient lookup of reports.

### PriorityQueue

A `PriorityQueue` is used to maintain reports based on their reporting time, allowing recent reports to be accessed efficiently.

