## ▶️ How to Run

1. Clone the repository.
2. Open the project in IntelliJ IDEA, Eclipse, or VS Code.
3. Open the `src` folder.
4. Compile the Java files.
5. Run `Main.java`.
6. Use the menu displayed in the console.

## 💻 Example Menu

```text
==================================
   EARPODS LOST & FOUND TRACKER
==================================

1. Report Lost Earpods
2. Report Found Earpods
3. Search by Brand
4. Search by Color
5. View Latest Unresolved Reports
6. Resolve Report
7. View All Reports
8. Exit
```

